From a029a01c2d8b86f410fdc8ed0b28f237c9071e48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 02:05:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tools/dvbridge: GPL-2.0-or-later in the files that may be

34 of the 42 files of tools/dvbridge that carry a licence line now say
GPL-2.0-or-later; the other 8 stay GPL-3.0-or-later, as they were. Only
comments change: each C file without its comments is the same as before
(gcc -fpreprocessed), and so is the vertex shader without its comment
lines.

GPL-2.0-or-later:
- the 22 files that Hades wrote (their copyright line names Hades);
- 12 that came from CroqueMr's Dolby Vision fork of LibreELEC, whose
  author has offered his original contributions under GPL-2.0-or-later
  since 2026-10-22 (CB1/docs/GPL2-MIGRATION.md and ADAPTER-MIGRATION.md
  of github.com/CroqueMr/libreelec-x86-DV, read at main 572faa4054e8):
  the frame transaction (dvbridge_core.c and .h), the FEL queue
  (dvbridge_fel.c and .h, from kodi-9990-native-dv and from the
  kodi-9993 of R0.2.1-opt1), the GL frame (dvbridge_gl_frame.c and .h),
  the metadata validation for libplacebo (dvbridge_placebo.c and .h),
  the public import and render interfaces (dvbridge_dmabuf.h,
  dvbridge_render.h), the header of the GL packer (dvbridge_gl_pack.h)
  and its vertex shader (pack_gles300.vert). Their header now says where
  they come from and gives the copyright of Hades for its changes; the
  vertex shader, which Hades did not change, says where it comes from.

GPL-3.0-or-later, unchanged:
- dvbridge_metadata.h, mpv_dvbridge_cm4.h and pack_gles300.frag: the
  metadata serializer, the content mapping v4.0 helper and the transport
  packing, which the fork took from Intel DV Linux and its mpv adapter,
  with PGenerator-Plus (GPL-3.0-or-later) as the reference for the
  transport (docs/ORIGIN.md of the fork at v0.1.0-rc1, and
  PROVENANCE.json). The documents of the offer leave them out: they call
  the serializer imported and these helpers inherited, and replace them;
- dvbridge_render.c: the fork's packing in one pass ("same
  arithmetic/packing as pack_gles300.frag");
- dvbridge_gl_pack.c and dvbridge_source.c: Hades' shaders there carry
  the parity and the metadata bits of pack_gles300.frag;
- dvbridge_eos.h: it carries the CRC function of the serializer;
- dvbridge_dmabuf.c: the fork's check of the DMA-BUF descriptors
  (dvbridge_dmabuf_validate_p010()), which the documents of the offer
  list as replaced, not as offered.

PROVENANCE.json and CMakeLists.txt carry no licence line and do not
change.
